                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "往常，我可以避开。\n但是今天，\n风，突然把我带到这座陌生星屿。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203300301_308381093_content",
                "value": "往常，我可以避开。\n但是今天，\n风，突然把我带到这座陌生星屿。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
